1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,507
DeepSeek says the final training run of its base model cost about five and a half million dollars.

2
00:00:06,507 --> 00:00:11,097
The American giants, you may remember, were spending billions.

3
00:00:11,097 --> 00:00:17,152
That day, the American chip company Nvidia loses around five hundred and ninety billion dollars in value.

4
00:00:17,152 --> 00:00:20,103
That's about fifty lakh crore rupees.

5
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:22,116
Think about that number for a second.

6
00:00:22,116 --> 00:00:29,546
It's roughly the size of India's whole Union Budget for that year... gone from one company in one day.

7
00:00:29,546 --> 00:00:35,134
Three days later, in Delhi, India's I.T. minister, Ashwini Vaishnaw, makes a promise.

8
00:00:35,134 --> 00:00:40,934
India will build its own A.I. model... and he hopes it will be ready within six months.

9
00:00:40,934 --> 00:00:43,426
So did India keep that promise?

10
00:00:43,426 --> 00:00:44,371
You'll see.

11
00:00:44,371 --> 00:00:49,888
And around minute ten, I'll run that same chopping test for you again... on an Indian machine.

12
00:00:49,888 --> 00:00:51,504
That's where it gets interesting.

13
00:00:51,504 --> 00:00:55,641
But first, you need to know what's actually inside one of these machines.

14
00:00:55,641 --> 00:00:57,481
Because it isn't magic.

15
00:00:57,481 --> 00:00:58,745
It's three things.

16
00:00:58,745 --> 00:01:02,833
Picture a child who has read every book in a giant library.

17
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:06,369
You start a sentence... and the child guesses your next word.

18
00:01:06,369 --> 00:01:07,406
Then the next one.

19
00:01:07,406 --> 00:01:08,464
Then the next.

20
00:01:08,464 --> 00:01:10,703
That's really all a chatbot does.

21
00:01:10,703 --> 00:01:16,259
It guesses the next piece, again and again, so well that you feel it's thinking.

22
00:01:16,259 --> 00:01:19,391
So if you want to build one, you need three things.

23
00:01:19,391 --> 00:01:20,843
A library to read.

24
00:01:20,843 --> 00:01:22,785
A reading room where it can read.

25
00:01:22,785 --> 00:01:25,440
And teachers who know how to train the child.

